{
 "duration": 51.918,
 "estimated": true,
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "In eighteen sixty-nine, workers digging a well in New York",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.861
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "found a giant stone man, almost ten feet tall.",
   "start": 4.041,
   "end": 7.263
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "But he was no ancient giant.",
   "start": 7.443,
   "end": 9.483
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "He started as an argument.",
   "start": 9.663,
   "end": 11.364
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "A cigar maker named George Hull",
   "start": 11.544,
   "end": 13.585
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "argued with a preacher about giants in the Bible.",
   "start": 13.765,
   "end": 16.826
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "So Hull decided to make one.",
   "start": 17.006,
   "end": 19.047
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "He had a huge block of stone cut in Iowa,",
   "start": 19.227,
   "end": 22.788
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "and a sculptor carved it into a giant.",
   "start": 22.968,
   "end": 25.689
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "text": "Then he buried it on a farm in Cardiff,",
   "start": 25.869,
   "end": 29.091
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "text": "for a whole year.",
   "start": 29.271,
   "end": 30.631
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "text": "When diggers finally hit the stone foot,",
   "start": 30.811,
   "end": 33.352
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "text": "the whole town went wild.",
   "start": 33.532,
   "end": 35.233
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "text": "People paid twenty-five cents to see him.",
   "start": 35.413,
   "end": 37.794
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "text": "Even the showman P. T. Barnum",
   "start": 37.974,
   "end": 40.655
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "text": "built his own copy.",
   "start": 40.835,
   "end": 42.195
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "text": "Then Hull confessed, and it was all a hoax.",
   "start": 42.375,
   "end": 45.596
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "text": "Today the giant is still on display in Cooperstown.",
   "start": 45.776,
   "end": 48.838
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "text": "Not bad for one argument.",
   "start": 49.018,
   "end": 50.718
  }
 ]
}